repository-code: "https://github.com/BrianZhu1999/SPADE"
url: "https://brianzhu1999.github.io/SPADE/"
abstract: >-
  SPADE discovers partial differential equations from observed physical fields
  through recursive algebraic and differential expression construction, shared
  intermediate-field computation, weak-form evaluation and compact equation
  selection.
keywords:
  - partial differential equations
  - symbolic regression
  - scientific machine learning
  - equation discovery
